msgstr ""
":meth:`!threading.Condition.notifyAll`: از "
":meth:`~threading.Condition.notify_all` استفاده کنید."

msgid ":meth:`!threading.Event.isSet`: use :meth:`~threading.Event.is_set`."
msgstr ""
":meth:`!threading.Event.isSet`: از :meth:`~threading.Event.is_set` استفاده "
"کنید."

msgid ""
":meth:`!threading.Thread.isDaemon`, :meth:`threading.Thread.setDaemon`: use "
":attr:`threading.Thread.daemon` attribute."
msgstr ""
":meth:`!threading.Thread.isDaemon`، :meth:`threading.Thread.setDaemon`: از "
