msgid ""
":mod:`xml.etree.ElementTree`: Testing the truth value of an "
":class:`~xml.etree.ElementTree.Element` is deprecated. In a future release "
"it will always return ``True``. Prefer explicit ``len(elem)`` or ``elem is "
